  "result": "Perfect! All **249 tests pass** (14 new VAT summary tests + 235 existing tests).\n\n**Implementation summary:**\n\nI added `vatSummary(invoices)` to `src/reports.js` that:\n\n1. **Filters** invoices to only those with status 'issued', 'partially_paid', or 'paid'\n2. **Calculates** for each line:\n   - `base` = lineTotal - lineDiscount (amount subject to VAT)\n   - `vat` = the VAT amount at that rate\n3. **Groups** by VAT rate, accumulating base and vat for all lines at each rate\n4. **Returns** array of `{ rate, base, vat }` entries\n5. **Sorts** by rate from high to low (21%, 9%, 0%)\n\n**Test coverage includes:**\n- Filtering out draft invoices\n- Including issued, partially_paid, and paid invoices\n- Correct base and VAT calculation\n- Grouping and accumulation by rate\n- Sorting order verification\n- Handling multiple VAT rates in single invoice\n- All required fields present\n\nThe VAT calculation uses the line calculations from `invoices.js` to ensure consistency with how invoices compute their totals.",
